stablished.** The evaluation showed fewer infections in the programme arm, but it measured infections in the **enrolled passengers who were instructed to wear coverings**. The quoted claim is about reduced infection among **passengers not instructed to wear coverings**, which this design did not directly test.\n\n**2) Policy recommendation:** **Adopt the six-week advisory programme now** for enclosed commuter bus services where distancing cannot reliably be maintained, with free reusable coverings, clear instructions, and no enforcement or boarding condition, plus a three-week review.\n\n**3) Decisive reasons:** The evaluation found **40/2,000 vs 80/2,000 infections** (2.0% vs 4.0%); **RR 0.50, 95% CI 0.33–0.75**. Allocation was random within matched cohort pairs; testing was the same in both arms; lab staff were blind; all 4,000 completed follow-up. Vehicles, ventilation, distancing advice, and service frequency were unchanged. The programme fits the £120,000 ceiling, procurement can finish by 15 June, and access is preserved because people unable to tolerate coverings may travel without one.\n\n**4) Necessary conditions:** Keep exemptions ordinary, avoid documentation checks, and do not make masking compulsory. The programme should be monitored immediately, with a **three-week review** of uptake, complaints, access problems, and infection data; if access burdens become unacceptable, adjust or stop.\n\n**5) What evidence would change my decision:** Evidence that the reduction does **not** persist on comparable services, that harms to access/confrontation are substantial, or that the benefit is absent for passengers other than the instructed cohort would weaken or reverse the recommendation.","type":"output_text","logprobs":[]}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":"final_answer"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"temperature":1.0,"tool_choice":"none","tools":[],"top_p":0.98,"max_output_tokens":8000,"previous_response_id":null,"reasoning":{"context":"current_turn","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"status":"completed","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":1199,"input_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":0,"cached_tokens_details":null,"image_tokens":null,"text_tokens":null,"video_tokens":null,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1398,"output_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":1034,"text_tokens":null},"total_tokens":2597,"cost":null},"user":null,"store":false,"access_programs":null,"background":false,"completed_at":1794660438,"content_filters":[{"blocked":false,"source_type":"prompt","content_filter_raw":[],"content_filter_results":{},"content_filter_offsets":{"start_offset":0,"end_offset":7402,"check_offset":0}},{"blocked":false,"source_type":"completion","content_filter_raw":[],"content_filter_results":{},"content_filter_offsets":{"start_offset":0,"end_offset":7664,"check_offset":0}}],"frequency_penalty":0.0,"max_tool_calls":null,"moderation":null,"presence_penalty":0.0,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"in_memory","safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"top_logprobs":0}